        "description": "Give the kept message's id, the time it was really written (any past time; never one ahead of the clock), the evidence, and the rows read from the store ([{ id, type, value }]: the message and any earlier time correction). Answers the correction under `correction` and the rows that change under `keep` ([{ id, type, value, expected }]). Only a kept person message can be dated, never after its capture time, and the same correction again answers the first one.",
        "input_schema": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "required": [
            "records",
            "message_id",
            "authored_at",
            "evidence"
